{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11235090","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11235090","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1123509001:1":{"text":"족장님, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 감사합니다...","source_cn":"族长，<style=stress><player_na...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4FAB002D1B261055","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"족장님, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 감사합니다...","female":"족장님, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 감사합니다...","variant_male_record_index":"126229","variant_female_record_index":"126230","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1123509002:1":{"text":"이곳은 강력한 강철 악어가 다른 야수들에게서 빼앗은 영역이었습니다.","source_cn":"这片领地曾是一只强大的钢颚兽，从其他野兽那里夺取而来的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4530B1485C269F68","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1123509003:1":{"text":"강철 악어가 다친 틈을 타서 영역 다툼을 하던 다른 야수들이 이곳을 되찾으려고 한 거죠.","source_cn":"当这只钢颚兽受伤，争夺地盘的其他野兽便想趁机夺回这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB858F467EA1C0C27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1123509004:1":{"text":"엥? 그럼 왜 늙고 기력이 약해진 틈을 노리지 않은 거지?","source_cn":"啊？那为什么不趁它年老力衰的时候过来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EC3FCA9B2F56423","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1123509005:1":{"text":"노련한 강철 악어를 얕보면 안 돼요. 체격은 이전과 같지 않지만, 경험이 풍부해서 반격이 꽤 위협적이거든요.","source_cn":"不要小瞧年老力衰的钢颚兽，虽然体格大不如从前，但是作战...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0603FC1401ADA5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1123509006:1":{"text":"경험이지...","source_cn":"经验嘛……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA312497480BB0E65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1123509007:1":{"text":"배움과 성장의 기회는 어디에나 있습니다. 하쉬르, 우리는 정말로 당신의 지혜와 경험이 필요해요.","source_cn":"学习和成长的机会无处不在，哈什尔，我们真的需要你的知识...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCC57D12561ACC6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1123509008:1":{"text":"하지만... 나는...","source_cn":"可是……我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0F083F8E5A5D978","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1123509009:1":{"text":"전통은 블랙하울 부족의 번영을 위해 존재하는 것 아니겠습니까? 부족으로 돌아가시지요.","source_cn":"传统是服务黑嚎氏族繁荣的，不是吗？回到氏族吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD91E3AA0B304A966","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1123509010:1":{"text":"생각해 보지.","source_cn":"我会再考虑的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1714901DD27899B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1123509011:1":{"text":"우리의 노력이 헛되지 않기를...","source_cn":"希望，我们的努力没有白费……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C62986A346FB000","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1123509012:1":{"text":"분명 돌아오시리라 믿습니다!","source_cn":"我相信老师，他一定会想通的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD026D38989D186C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1123509013:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 저희는 먼저 돌아가겠습니다. 시간 되실 때 블랙하울 부족으로 자주 놀러 오십시오.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x84AF65577ED6776F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 저희는 먼저 돌아가겠습니다. 시간 되실 때 블랙하울 부족으로 자주 놀러 오십시오.","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 저희는 먼저 돌아가겠습니다. 시간 되실 때 블랙하울 부족으로 자주 놀러 오십시오.","variant_male_record_index":"126242","variant_female_record_index":"126243","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:19:1123509014:1":{"text":"시간이 흐른 뒤, 크루거가 블랙하울 부족으로 우리를 초대했다...","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A222A7E4A45CC0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:驯兽师萨克":{"text":"조련사 사크","sourc